{"version":1,"content":"<p>最近一篇研究論文指出，近年來，遊戲中的DEI，也就是多元化、公平和包容性內容，可能損害遊戲銷量和收入。據稱，一款遊戲裏的DEI元素越多，其銷售收入就可能下降近10%。在中國等較為保守的國家，這種影響更加明顯。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584986.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:58.996640+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:04:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_hash":"662312de3aedf8dcbb8f7b2f9eee78c96c4fda4cf0e8e0ec48cb98b028ef86bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}